AEMO ELECTRICITY MARKET NOTICE.

Reclassification of a non-credible contingency event as a credible contingency event due to lightning.

AEMO considers the simultaneous trip of the following circuits to now be more likely and reasonably possible. Accordingly AEMO has reclassified it as a credible contingency event.

Region: QLD

Lines: Goonyella - North Goonyella Tee - Stoney Creek No. 7122 and the Goonyella - Newlands No. 7155 132 kV lines.
